{1}{[The boy glances up.] Yes?}{[The boy glances up.] Yes?}{}{}{0}{ }
{2}{What are you doing here?}{}{5}{gf2981 0, gf2980 0}{100}{gf2980 1, qu1991 2}
{3}{What you doing?}{}{-4}{gf2981 0, gf2980 0}{100}{gf2980 1, qu1991 2}
