{21}{Bad men already dead. House safe now.}{}{-4}{gf2981 1, gf2982 1, gf2983 0, gf2978 1, gf2976 1}{410}{gf2983 1}
{100}{Cleaning the filings out. Carrying coal. Whatever Mr Appleby needs. If I stop, he says he can find another boy who knows when he's well off.}{Cleaning the filings out. Carrying coal. Whatever Mr Appleby needs. If I stop, he says he can find another boy who knows when he's well off.}{}{}{0}{ }
