{109}{I should let you get back to it.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{110}{I go.}{}{-4}{}{0}{ }
{120}{Toby Finch. I used to sleep under a cart near the docks. Now I sleep in the corner over there. There's less rain, anyway.}{Toby Finch. I used to sleep under a cart near the docks. Now I sleep in the corner over there. There's less rain, anyway.}{}{}{0}{ }
{121}{How did you come to work here?}{}{5}{gf2981 0}{140}{ }
{122}{How you get here?}{}{-4}{gf2981 0}{140}{ }
{123}{What would you like to do?}{}{5}{}{150}{ }
{124}{What you want?}{}{-4}{}{150}{ }
