{126}{More question.}{}{-4}{}{1}{ }
{127}{Take care, Toby.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{128}{Bye, Toby.}{}{-4}{}{0}{ }
{130}{No money. A bit of bread before work and thin soup after. He says the food and the roof cost more than my work is worth. So I owe him. It gets bigger every week, whatever I do.}{No money. A bit of bread before work and thin soup after. He says the food and the roof cost more than my work is worth. So I owe him. It gets bigger every week, whatever I do.}{}{}{0}{ }
{132}{You do not owe him sixteen hours of your life every day.}{}{5}{}{200}{ }
{133}{That not fair.}{}{-4}{}{200}{ }
{134}{Did you agree to any of this?}{}{5}{}{140}{ }
{135}{You say yes?}{}{-4}{}{140}{ }
{136}{I have heard enough.}{}{5}{}{1}{ }
{137}{I know now.}{}{-4}{}{1}{ }
{140}{He found me outside in the cold. Said a boy shouldn't be sleeping in the street. I thought he meant it. He brought me here, gave me soup, and said I could make myself useful in the morning. That was months ago.}{He found me outside in the cold. Said a boy shouldn't be sleeping in the street. I thought he meant it. He brought me here, gave me soup, and said I could make myself useful in the morning. That was months ago.}{}{}{0}{ }
{141}{And there is nobody you can go to?}{}{5}{}{145}{ }
{142}{Nobody help?}{}{-4}{}{145}{ }
{143}{Taking you in did not make you his property.}{}{5}{}{200}{ }
{144}{He not own you.}{}{-4}{}{200}{ }
{145}{Not that I know where to find. I tried leaving once. He caught me by the gate. Said he'd tell everyone I was a thief, and I'd never get honest work in Tarant again.}{Not that I know where to find. I tried leaving once. He caught me by the gate. Said he'd tell everyone I was a thief, and I'd never get honest work in Tarant again.}{}{}{0}{ }
{146}{I will speak to him.}{}{5}{}{200}{ }
{147}{I talk him.}{}{-4}{}{200}{ }
{148}{What would you do if you were free?}{}{5}{}{150}{ }
{149}{What you want?}{}{-4}{}{150}{ }
{150}{Sleep until I wake up on my own. Have enough to eat that I don't have to think about the next meal while I'm eating this one. After that... I'd like to learn to read properly. I know the numbers on the clock.}{Sleep until I wake up on my own. Have enough to eat that I don't have to think about the next meal while I'm eating this one. After that... I'd like to learn to read properly. I know the numbers on the clock.}{}{}{0}{ }
{151}{We can start with getting you out of here.}{}{5}{gf2981 0}{200}{ }
