{188}{I go.}{}{-4}{}{0}{ }
{200}{Would you? You could speak to him. He likes people to think he's a gentleman. Or come back after ten, when he stops watching the workshop. I can get out then. I just need somewhere to go.}{Would you? You could speak to him. He likes people to think he's a gentleman. Or come back after ten, when he stops watching the workshop. I can get out then. I just need somewhere to go.}{}{}{0}{ }
