{220}{[He lowers his voice.] I can slip out now. But if I have to come back here tomorrow, he'll make me wish I hadn't.}{[He lowers his voice.] I can slip out now. But if I have to come back here tomorrow, he'll make me wish I hadn't.}{}{}{0}{ }
{221}{You are leaving for good. Meet me outside the Bond residence at 1007 Kensington. Stay outside until I have made it safe.}{}{5}{gf2981 0, gf2986 1}{310}{gf2981 1, gf2985 1, qu1991 2}
